;; pays whoever holds tokens AT DECLARATION. State is asserted unchanged in both cases.
;; ===========================================================================
;; 🔴 FUT (effective ) has to LAND before a generation can seal — the design record refuses
;; to schedule while a declared round is pending-effective. The retro/present dates below are
